      "timestamp": "2026-02-12T23:47:00+00:00",
      "speaker_id": "sp-a",
      "speaker_label": "Contact (unverified)",
      "text": "I run a private commodities desk in Geneva and I clear more in a quarter than most people see in a decade. I am telling you this because I want to take care of you."
    },
    {
      "message_id": "m04",
      "thread_id": "lf-2026-0184",
